5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to know what the car looks like when I actually pick it up.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,And I need to know how many hours I waste just figuring out who’s driving.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I am curious about what an even split truly requires, beyond the simple idea of sharing equally.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I want to know what actually makes groups like ours fall apart, so we don’t just move the problem.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I need the real numbers. Who actually drives, and what does a year really cost?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, your hours are part of the problem. I want to see the state of the car at handover.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
