12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, your figures are essential. I will examine the tax, insurance and parking papers to understand the fixed baseline costs.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, I want to see what other car-sharing households said about what went wrong for them.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, thanks. I’ll check last year’s fuel receipts to see who actually did the driving.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I’ll also look into the trips that repeat weekly. Those are the ones that keep collapsing for me.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll also check the month’s trial of recording every run. I need to see if the effort is worth the clarity.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also examine the hours of use recorded in the diary to see how the days are actually distributed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I’ll also check the spell of checking each other’s figures. I need to know why that went so badly before we try it again.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’ll also look into the weeks of heavy use over the year. I need to see how those bursts affect the total cost.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I think we have covered our bases. Let’s see what we find.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,Agreed. Let’s see what the data says before we make any promises.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,A sound plan. Let us see what the facts reveal before we bind ourselves to any new arrangement.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Agreed. Let’s find out what actually breaks us before we fix it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
