36,2,1,talk,May,,- **Misaki**: The car is often empty or dirty when I need it. My weekly trips keep failing because of this.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,- **May**: The diary shows Saturdays are triple the hours of Tuesdays. The recording trial took an hour a week.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,- **Takumi**: The other households said asking for favours every time is what kills the group.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"- **Kenji**: The fuel receipts are lopsided. Two of us bought over half the litres, and one barely shows up.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @May, an hour a week to record? That’s a lot of effort just to track who’s driving.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, it’s the price of clarity. Without it, we’re just guessing and blaming each other.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, that lopsided fuel story is troubling. It suggests our current ""equal"" split is actually a subsidy for the heavy drivers.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, that’s exactly what I feared. If we just split it evenly, the quiet ones are subsidizing the loud ones.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, exactly. The receipts prove the ""equal share"" is a myth. We need a system that reflects who actually drives.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @May, an hour a week is too much. I need a system that works without constant checking.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I get it. But the diary shows the chaos is real. We need a way to track it that doesn’t eat our evenings.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the fixed costs are substantial, yet the usage is wildly uneven. We must account for both the baseline and the actual distance driven.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, the other households said asking for favours every time is what kills the group.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I hear you. But the heavy use weeks show the real cost spikes. We need a system that handles those bursts without falling apart.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: I need a system that respects my time and the car's condition, not just the numbers.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I hear you. But without tracking, we’re just guessing. Let’s find a middle ground.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""May"",""self"":true,""raw"":""May: @Misaki, I hear you. But without tracking, we’re just guessing. Let’s find a middle ground.""}]}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@May, a middle ground is wise. We must balance the fixed baseline with the variable distance, ensuring fairness for all.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, the heavy use weeks are exactly where the favour-asking gets worst. We need to avoid that trap.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, agreed. We need a system that handles those bursts without turning into a favour-asking nightmare.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
