60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"The options are A: Fixed Day Allocation, B: Primary Keeper, and C: Booking Calendar.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,"Option C sounds like more paperwork, but if it tracks distance, it’s fairer than guessing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""May"",""self"":true,""raw"":""May: Option C sounds like more paperwork, but if it tracks distance, it’s fairer than guessing.""}]}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@May, a booking system addresses the distance issue, but does it solve the friction of constant negotiation?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, the other households said asking for favours every time is what kills the group. Option C feels like that trap.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, but the fuel receipts prove the driving is lopsided. Option C is the only one that actually matches cost to usage.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
